 249:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****     Use Functions HAL_MMC_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback,
 250:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****     it allows to register following callbacks:
 251:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****       (+) TxCpltCallback : callback when a transmission transfer is completed.
 252:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****       (+) RxCpltCallback : callback when a reception transfer is completed.
 253:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****       (+) ErrorCallback : callback when error occurs.
 254:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****       (+) AbortCpltCallback : callback when abort is completed.
 255:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****       (+) Read_DMADblBuf0CpltCallback : callback when the DMA reception of first buffer is complete
 256:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****       (+) Read_DMADblBuf1CpltCallback : callback when the DMA reception of second buffer is complet
 257:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****       (+) Write_DMADblBuf0CpltCallback : callback when the DMA transmission of first buffer is comp
 258:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****       (+) Write_DMADblBuf1CpltCallback : callback when the DMA transmission of second buffer is com
 259:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_mmc.c ****       (+) MspInitCallback    : MMC MspInit.
